## FILES TO KEEP/ARCHIVE/DELETE

### ✅ KEEP (Production Critical)
- `integration_package/` - Ready to deploy
- `training/` scripts - For model improvement
- `evaluation/` scripts - For testing
- `preprocessing/` scripts - For data prep
- `datasets/dataset_cleaned/` - Production dataset
- `models/best_damage_model.pt` - Current model
- `docs/` - User guides
- `.git/` - Version control

### ⚠️ ARCHIVE (Optional)
- Other datasets (dataset_final, dataset_labeled, etc.) - Can be archived
- `outputs/runs/` - Training artifacts
- Legacy model files (yolov8n.pt, yolov8s.pt) - Can redownload
- Old outputs - Rarely needed

### 🗑️ SAFE TO DELETE
- `archive/` - Experimental code
- `__pycache__/` - Auto-generated
- Old temporary files
- Duplicate outputs

